Package: TEATIME
Title: Estimating EvolutionAry Events Through Single-Timepoint Sequencing
Version: 2.5.7
Authors@R:
    person("Hai", "Chen", email = "HaiChen294@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Derives evolutionary parameters — mutation rate, selection coefficient,
    and subclone emergence timing — from cancer sequencing data by analysing the
    composition of variant allele frequency (VAF) clusters. Supports pluggable
    growth models so custom tumour-evolution assumptions can be swapped in without
    touching core estimation code.
